# pak.syntax — nagelfar syntax database for the Pak Tcl compiler.
#
# Loaded via:  nagelfar -s tcl/tools/pak.syntax ...
#
# Our own pak::* procs are learned by nagelfar from the source files directly
# (they are checked on the same command line), so they need no entries here.
# This DB only declares EXTERNAL commands nagelfar can't see — currently just
# tcllib's struct::record ensemble. Add new third-party deps here as they are
# introduced, so the lint stays free of "Unknown command" noise without blanket
# message filters.
#
# Token legend: x=any arg  x*=zero-or-more  n=varName  s=subcommand  l=list

set ::syntax(struct::record) {s x*}
